          "title": "You'll want to know: ಕೆಟ್ಟ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೆಟ್ಟ — keṭṭa — \"bad, spoiled\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಕೆಟ್ಟ (keṭṭa) is native Dravidian, from keḍu, \"to be spoiled, become bad\", which DEDR 1942 lists; keṭṭa is its past form, \"spoiled\"; the entry also has Tamil keṭu and Malayalam keṭu."
            }
          ]
        },
